3><c>decision </c><00:00:02.334><c>in  </c><00:00:02.335><c>row </c><00:00:02.336><c>is </c><00:00:02.337><c>crucial </c><00:00:02.338><c>to </c><00:00:02.339><c>giving </c><00:00:02.340><c>women </c><00:00:02.341><c>the  </c><00:00:02.342><c>freedom </c><00:00:02.343><c>to </c><00:00:02.344><c>join </c><00:00:02.345><c>the </c><00:00:02.346><c>workforce </c><00:00:02.347><c>and </c><00:00:02.348><c>make  </c><00:00:02.349><c>decisions </c><00:00:02.350><c>about </c><00:00:02.351><c>when </c><00:00:02.352><c>to </c><00:00:02.353><c>have </c><00:00:02.354><c>children </c><00:00:02.355><c>to  </c><00:00:02.356><c>learn </c><00:00:02.357><c>more </c><00:00:02.358><c>about </c><00:00:02.359><c>this </c><00:00:02.360><c>case </c><00:00:02.361><c>visit </c><00:00:02.362><c>the  </c><00:00:02.363><c>national </c><00:00:02.364><c>constitution </c><00:00:02.365><c>center's  </c><00:00:02.366><c>interactive </c><00:00:02.367><c>constitution </c><00:00:02.368><c>and </c><00:00:02.369><c>khan  </c><00:00:02.370><c>academy's </c><00:00:02.371><c>resources </c><00:00:02.372><c>on </c><00:00:02.373><c>u.s </c><00:00:02.374><c>government  </c><00:00:02.375><c>and </c><00:00:02.376><c>politics</c>

